## 6. Go baseline references

At commit `cd08f10`:

- `internal/record/record.go` -- DefaultDir, run ID, report, finding
  spill, monthly index, SeenBefore.
- `internal/record/meta.go` -- Meta shape, RunDir, meta/artifact
