+# CLI commands
+
+- Register CommandDefs in `commands.ts`; `run.ts` already builds the
+  nested command tree. Add group children through `subcommands`.
+- Declare string positionals in the builder and read dashed names with
+  bracket notation. Shared parsing rejects surplus positionals before
+  invoking a handler.
+- Handlers use the injected cwd, env and signal. Resolve the records
+  directory once and delegate run-ID validation to the records module.
+- Keep raw index lines as Buffer through stdout; decoding and re-encoding
+  can change invalid UTF-8. Stored reports use `textsafe.textBytes` so
+  invalid bytes and terminal controls become visible escapes.
+- Error causes affect exit-code classification, but only the outer
+  message is printed. Include useful filesystem context in that message.
+- CLI tests use `runRoast` and must pass `cwd:repo.dir` explicitly when
+  using an existing TempDir fixture. Record tests use `recordRepo` to
+  chdir and isolate home/config; import new tests in `test/index.ts`.
